  "title": "HTTP2: Add heuristic dissector for on TCP directly",
  "description": "The current heuristic dissector described as \"HTTP2 over TCP\" is\nonly used within the HTTP dissector, either when there's already\na HTTP connection but the Upgrade header is missing, or for\nports that are configured to use the HTTP dissector (which otherwise\nwill call it File Data.)\n\nAdd heuristic detection for connections on TCP that start out\nwith the HTTP/2 magic bytes but are not ports configured to HTTP,\nsuch as the capture in #19677. (Somewhat related to #19038.)",
